  "rationale": "The recall floor encodes a stated preference for catching a substantial share of defaulters.  Without a verified cost matrix this is not a claim that a missed defaulter always costs more than a false alarm.  A precision floor acknowledges that a review team cannot investigate an arbitrarily large number of false alarms.  PR-AUC is the primary ranking metric because the positive class is the minority.",
